# Claude Code. Worktrees and per-machine state under here are never committed — but the project
# SETTINGS are, because they carry Rule 0 (no AI attribution). They live in the repo rather than
# only in the umbrella folder above it: a session started HERE, which CLAUDE.md Rule 2 tells you to
# do before a push, does not load the umbrella's settings, and the harness default is attribution ON.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
